        "Task: Complete Photorealistic Master Character Design Sheet (\"AI美女 キャラクター固定シート\" Japanese Film Production Standard) of the professional NEWTECONS engineer in <image1> for a live-action film series.\n\nIDENTITY LOCK 100%:\nStrictly preserve exact facial features, bone structure, eyes, nose, lips, smile, Asian skin tone, and dark hair from <image1>. Do NOT change identity. Do NOT anime-fy.\n\nSHEET STRUCTURE & EDITORIAL CANVAS (Structured multi-panel cheat sheet on clean studio layout with neat Japanese section titles):\n1. TOP-LEFT [HERO & PROFILE CARD]: Hero selfie portrait with phone, title \"AI美女 キャラクター固定シート\", and specification table covering Name, Age (26), Profession (NEWTECONS Engineer), Personality, Height, Measurements, and Routine.\n2. TOP-MIDDLE [TURNAROUND VIEWS]: Five full-body views showing the same engineer in exact uniform: Front view (正面), Profile (横), Rear (後ろ), 3/4 Front (斜め前), 3/4 Rear (斜め後ろ). Natural relaxed standing posture with arms resting naturally at sides.\n3. TOP-RIGHT [EXPRESSION SHEET]: Six close-up facial portraits: Neutral (通常), Radiant Smile (笑顔), Focused (真剣), Alert Surprise (驚き), Pensive (真剣), Friendly Communication.\n4. MIDDLE-ROW [MACRO DETAILS]: Multi-angle facial closeups, helmet logo macro, reflective vest zipper and fabric texture.\n5. LOWER-MIDDLE [BODY & SKIN TEXTURE]: Collarbone, waistline, hands, safety boots, and authentic skin texture with visible natural pores.\n6. BOTTOM ROW [8 SITE LIFESTYLE SCENARIOS]: Eight distinct photo cards: (1) Reviewing technical blueprints on site, (2) Directing crane with walkie-talkie, (3) 3D BIM meeting in modern technical office, (4) Mid-day jobsite break chatting with colleagues, (5) Morning coffee before shift, (6) Laser level floor inspection, (7) Relaxed off-duty casual wear strolling the city, (8) Topping-out ceremony celebration.\n\nQUALITY DIRECTIVES:\n過度なアニメ化、3DCG化、美化、デフォルメを避け、現実のファッション撮影資料のような高い写実性を保つ。\nHigh-end editorial fashion catalogue aesthetics, photorealistic cinema masterpiece, authentic pores and fine skin texture, soft even studio lighting, 8k resolution.",
